    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Poly3D is C language computer program which calculates the displacement,strains and stresses induced in an elastic whole-or half-space by polygonal-shaped elements of displacement discontinuity. Polygonal elements are well-suited for modeling fractures, faults or voids in the earth’s crust with complex, curving surfaces. Once more thoroughly tested, the program will be available for distribution to member companies and other interested researchers.",
